{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50793","headline":"游仙 · 张祜","name":"游仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤足一仙翁，耳毫垂两颈。\n摩娑雪毛项，骑上崑仑顶。\n顾我踨鹿蹄，去游遐寂境。\n洞门出昏黑，却望如侧井。\n行折青桂枝，隔云敲石屏。\n空岩响深彻，台观凝碧冷。\n风触琼树花，动摇天水影。\n端衣礼真貌，心目明耿耿。\n愿侣牧羊儿，休休在崖岭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}